OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fwith light showers around to start
OL,7,Fthis evening. Showers becoming more
OL,8,Ffrequent into the early hours of
OL,9,FSaturday but with winds easing. A
OL,10,Fchillier night than the last.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA mixed day with scattered
OL,13,Fshowers, particularly in the north,
OL,14,Fbut with plenty of sunny spells too.
OL,15,FShowers and winds easing during the
OL,16,Fevening. Feeling cooler than on Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
